      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here's a draft response that aims to address the issues while sounding sincere and professional:\n\n\"We apologize for the disappointing experience at our breakfast buffet. It's clear that we fell short of our standard, and we're truly sorry for the inconvenience and frustration this caused. We'retaking immediate action to review our breakfast service and ensure that our customers receive the high-quality experience they expect from The Azure Boutique. We appreciate your feedback and would like to invite you to contact us directly so we can make things right.\"\n\nI aimed for a measured tone that acknowledges the issues and shows a commitment to improvement. I've avoided using overly cheerful language to keep the focus on sincere apologies and concrete actions.",
